       "type": "markdown",
       "value": "Directions: There are two passages in this part. Each passage is followed by some questions or unfinished statements. For each of them there are four choices marked A, B, C, and D. You are required to select the ONE that best fits into the statement. Mark the corresponding letter On the Answer Sheet with a single line through the centre."
