       "type": "markdown",
       "value": "Directions: There are 10 blanks in the following passage. For each blank there are 4 choices marked A, B, C, and D. You are required to choose the ONE that best fits into the passage. Then mark the corresponding letter On the Answer Sheet with a single line through the centre."
