    "sharedChoices": [],
    "materials": [
     {
      "blocks": [
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": "Holidays are a wonderful time to spend with friends and family, eating and sharing stories. Whether you are waiting at airports or spending time on trains, buses or cars, these situations can give you great "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "q31",
        "placeholder": "31"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " to learn English. Here are some ideas that you can use to improve your English over the holidays.\n### Published materials\nAirports and train stations often have "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "q32",
        "placeholder": "32"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " selling published materials. Buy an English-language publication to read it while you are waiting or spending quiet time at a hotel or in a home. Look at the images and read the lines below them. "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "q33",
        "placeholder": "33"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " you do not understand all the words, you can use the images to help you understand some of them. Later, you can use an online dictionary to look "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "q34",
        "placeholder": "34"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " the words you want to learn.\n### Conversation\nWhile traveling, we "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "q35",
        "placeholder": "35"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " see people from other countries who are also waiting or exploring a new place. If you hear someone asking for information in English, you "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "q36",
        "placeholder": "36"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " offer to help or simply greet them in English. A friendly conversation is usually welcome "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "q37",
        "placeholder": "37"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " travelers share their experiences.\n### Writing about your day\nWriting about your day is a great way to "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "q38",
        "placeholder": "38"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " your English writing skill. Draw images of "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "q39",
        "placeholder": "39"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " you see or do in your travels and look up the English words for the places or events later if you cannot think of them at the time. Using English to "
       },
       {
        "type": "blank",
        "key": "q40",
        "placeholder": "40"
       },
       {
        "type": "markdown",
        "value": " your holiday will help you to put new words to use and make them stay in your memory longer. And you will have a wonderful record of your travel to look at long after the holiday is over."
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
